<title>JAPAN: Aoki International - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aoki International - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    33.74		vs	   35.97</p>
<p> Operating	    3.96		vs	    4.01</p>
<p> Current		3.56		vs	    3.92</p>
<p> Net		    1.86		vs	    2.04</p>
<p> EPS		   34.88 yen	  vs	   38.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     53 million	  vs	  53 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	    9.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 1.50 yen	  vs		 -   </p>
<p>    NOTE - Aoki International Co Ltd is a major suburban</p>
<p>discount store operator specialising in men's suits.</p>
</text>
